  "description": "*“My body has been stolen. And by my husband’s mistress at that!”*\n\nKanami is a full-time housewife living in a high-rise apartment in Minato Ward. For her, elegance had become her daily life, but one day, she wakes up in the body of a stranger. Amidst the confusion, Kanami soon realizes. The owner of this body is her husband’s mistress. Returning home in confusion, Kanami is plunged into even greater shock when she witnesses the woman in her body sitting with her husband as if nothing had happened. Someone has entered my body. If things continue like this, I will lose my husband and my life entirely. I must return to my original body. Just then, a mysterious figure appears.\n\n *“Your husband has at least three more women.”*\n\nBesides me and that woman, there is someone else yet to be revealed.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
